id: DRAFT-kirigami-6-18-0-qml-theme-resource-staging
draft: true
contributor_id: zxyAtom
title: Stage the upstream KDE Desktop Theme.qml at the Qt Quick CTest resource path
trigger_tool: ctest
phase: testing
error_signature: tst_icon\.qml|Missing upstream test theme|org/kde/kirigami/Theme\.qml
severity: medium
category: testing,qt_qml,packaging
match_keywords: kirigami,Qt Quick,QML,Theme.qml,tst_icon.qml,CTest,resource staging,OHOS
root_cause: Kirigami's Qt Quick icon test resolves the KDE Desktop Theme.qml from the build-tree resource path, while ordinary QML import paths only expose installed modules and leave that test data unavailable.
affected_scope: Kirigami 6.18.0 Qt Quick upstream tests on OHOS when BUILD_TESTING is enabled and the source theme at src/styles/org.kde.desktop/Theme.qml is not materialized below build/bin/org/kde/kirigami.
verification_cmd: conan create archives/k/kirigami/6.18.0 -pr:h ohos-aarch64
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: stage-upstream-qml-test-theme
rec_description: Before CTest, copy the upstream org.kde.desktop Theme.qml into build/bin/org/kde/kirigami/Theme.qml, then run the original Qt Quick test suite while explicitly excluding only tst_theme.qml when the OHOS runner lacks the required desktop platform plugin and font data.
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: disable BUILD_TESTING or exclude tst_icon\.qml instead of staging Theme\.qml
forbid_1_reason: The missing resource is specific to the icon-test lookup contract, so skipping the whole suite or the icon test removes real upstream coverage instead of supplying the required test input.
forbid_1_consequence: The package can appear healthy while its QML resource lookup path and icon behavior remain untested.
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E294
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-kirigami-6-18-0-qml-theme-resource-staging.md
last_updated: 2026-09-05
source_event: Kirigami 6.18.0 merged adaptation PR #7443, historical target CI #37386
authors: zxyAtom
source_pr: 7443
source_commit: 15ecf61916a821514f97015576678e00f5d86f8c
